                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game just doesn't work correctly on a modern PC with a modern display. Upon first booting the game I could tell that when I exited all of my windows would be 1/4 their size. No big deal. I changed the resolution to match my screen resolution and rebooted the game as per the on-screen instructions. Upon booting back into the game I can only see the upper right quadrant of the game. Now my mouse cannot reach the \"set back to defaults\" option and the keyboard doesn't work for this. \n\nThe game looked like it would be a decent time getting to pretend it's 2007, but if you do play this game just suffer through the default graphical settings or else.",
